{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435810/extras/library_header.png?t=1751056844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GoodMan is a 2D platform game. With its fluid platform mechanics and exciting combat system, each level offers a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The war that began 20 billion years ago has now taken on a new dimension. <strong>GoodMan </strong>fights against the dark forces threatening the universe, this time by jumping from platform to platform. Can you complete this great struggle and stop the BadMan?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The oldest hero of the universe, the circle, is now before you as GoodMan! As the number of BadMan increases day by day, he has gained new abilities to stop them. With his gravity-defying jumps and enhanced weapons, he fights against the army of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level presents a challenge filled with new difficulties. The BadMan are now smarter, faster, and more dangerous! You'll need to progress by jumping from platform to platform, avoiding enemies, and defeating them. Remember, when you destroy each BadMan, stronger ones will take their place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How far can you go in this endless struggle? Are you ready to save the universe? GoodMan's fate is in your hands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435810?t=1751056844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751056844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435810/1fb8646af4b50f24f35cfa4036ac5b6ff50f26a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751056844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435810/1fb8646af4b50f24f35cfa4036ac5b6ff50f26a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751056844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>GoodMan Workshop</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience hundreds of unique community-created maps with GoodMan's workshop support, or share your own creative ideas with the community!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435810/extras/library_header.png?t=1751056844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GoodMan is a 2D platform game. With its fluid platform mechanics and exciting combat system, each level offers a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The war that began 20 billion years ago has now taken on a new dimension. <strong>GoodMan </strong>fights against the dark forces threatening the universe, this time by jumping from platform to platform. Can you complete this great struggle and stop the BadMan?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The oldest hero of the universe, the circle, is now before you as GoodMan! As the number of BadMan increases day by day, he has gained new abilities to stop them. With his gravity-defying jumps and enhanced weapons, he fights against the army of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level presents a challenge filled with new difficulties. The BadMan are now smarter, faster, and more dangerous! You'll need to progress by jumping from platform to platform, avoiding enemies, and defeating them. Remember, when you destroy each BadMan, stronger ones will take their place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How far can you go in this endless struggle? Are you ready to save the universe? GoodMan's fate is in your hands!</p>","developers":["mronlykemal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435810/7fbf6b528e1d61130135adeef41fdaeba1ce1993/header.jpg?t=1751056844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156291,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156291/movie480.mp4?t=1749807752","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156291/movie_max.mp4?t=1749807752"},"name":"GoodMan Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156291/c092b6151aa8804f35c3e0ff2393e08435f02f03/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749807752","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156291/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749807752","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156291/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749807752"}}],"name":"GoodMan","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA